<title>POLAND: GPRD wins PLN 23.6 mln contract.</title>
<headline>GPRD wins PLN 23.6 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish road builder GPRD SA signed a 23.6 million zloty contract with the Szczecin road authority to modernise a road in western Poland, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The statement said the project would be financed by the European Union's Phare programme which helps countries in central and eastern Europe modernise their economies and infrastructure.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
